# =============================================================================
# Frontend environment (Vite — variables must be prefixed with VITE_)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local dev: copy to `frontend/.env.local` (gitignored) if you need overrides.
#
# Render — Static Site: Dashboard → your static site → Environment
#   Add at build time:
#     VITE_API_URL=https://YOUR-API-SERVICE.onrender.com
#   Use your Web Service (Express API) public URL — NOT the static site custom domain.
#   No trailing slash. Example: https://agc-member-portal.onrender.com
#   (SPA custom domain is https://memberportal.amirgc.com — API stays on its Render URL unless you add api.*)
#
# After changing VITE_* vars, trigger a new deploy so `npm run build` picks them up.
# =============================================================================

# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com

# Public base URL for org chart headshots in Spaces (same as backend DO_SPACES_PUBLIC_URL, no trailing slash).
# After uploading with `npm run upload:org-chart` in `backend/`, images load from `${VITE_ORG_CHART_ASSETS_BASE}/org-chart/...`.
# VITE_ORG_CHART_ASSETS_BASE=https://your-bucket.tor1.digitaloceanspaces.com
